{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Amateur Scout to World-Class Talent Finder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise to the top as a football scout and academy manager. Spot hidden gems at youth matches, sign them before anyone else, and guide their journey from unknown talent to global superstar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scout Real Talent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/d3e8e40226838062555ef33624092767.poster.avif?t=1755349220\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/d3e8e40226838062555ef33624092767.webm?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/d3e8e40226838062555ef33624092767.mp4?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend youth matches and uncover players with unique strengths, weaknesses, and personalities. The more you observe, the more you\u2019ll reveal \u2014 until you know exactly who has what it takes to go pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sign &amp; Develop Future Stars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/c6cc54675322709b808f863d682fd6bb.poster.avif?t=1755349220\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/c6cc54675322709b808f863d682fd6bb.webm?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/c6cc54675322709b808f863d682fd6bb.mp4?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure promising prospects with smart contracts. Assign personalized training focuses and watch their skills, confidence, and value grow with every season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a World-Class Academy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/33a0195a34d417bac0f76b6516415ace.poster.avif?t=1755349220\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/33a0195a34d417bac0f76b6516415ace.webm?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/33a0195a34d417bac0f76b6516415ace.mp4?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade facilities to maximize player potential \u2014 from top-tier training grounds to a cutting-edge scouting wing. Invest wisely to turn your academy into a football powerhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Transfer Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/0f5e5b46b58f3b450bcb266982ffd7b8.poster.avif?t=1755349220\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/0f5e5b46b58f3b450bcb266982ffd7b8.webm?t=1755349220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell players at peak value to interested clubs. Negotiate performance bonuses, sell-on clauses, and perfect timing to maximize profit \u2014 every deal builds your prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each success, your reputation grows. Unlock better leagues, higher-profile matches, and stronger players. Become the scout every club dreams of hiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout matches to reveal hidden talent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign, train, and develop promising players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your academy for maximum growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate transfers with clubs worldwide</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1755349220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1755349220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/5f2b5c548957d544170d8f5d919ce4e4811e8696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755349220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/5f2b5c548957d544170d8f5d919ce4e4811e8696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755349220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Amateur Scout to World-Class Talent Finder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise to the top as a football scout and academy manager. Spot hidden gems at youth matches, sign them before anyone else, and guide their journey from unknown talent to global superstar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scout Real Talent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 